{"3657450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gorilla Vs 100 Men", "steam_appid": 3657450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can One Gorilla Beat 100 Men?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fur of an unstoppable gorilla and answer the internet's most chaotic question. In this fast-paced, ragdoll-fueled arcade brawler, you're dropped into a nonstop brawl where men just keep coming—and your fists do the talking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash, punch, and pummel your way enemies in an over-the-top frenzy and mayhem. Go for the classic 100-man challenge or see how long you can survive in unlimited mode. There are no waves, no breaks—just you, pure muscle, and a crowd of unlucky humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, addictive gameplay makes it easy to pick up and hard to put down. Whether you're jumping in for a quick session or chasing high-body-count glory, it's pure, primal chaos from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customization</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Gorilla</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change up your gorilla’s look with a full range of options — mix and match skin color, fur color, shorts, ties, glasses, and hats to make your fighter stand out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a gorilla in a hilarious brawler</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch and pummel endless enemies in brutal, chaotic combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two modes: Beat 100 men or face an unlimited onslaught</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant action, no fluff—just pure arcade fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdoll physics make every fight wild and unpredictable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear your rear with a hilarious fart-poop blast that sends foes flying behind you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pound your chest to unleash a powerful shockwave, forcing all nearby enemies to step back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly re-playable with short, intense gameplay sessions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can one gorilla beat 100 men? There’s only one way to find out.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can One Gorilla Beat 100 Men?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fur of an unstoppable gorilla and answer the internet's most chaotic question. In this fast-paced, ragdoll-fueled arcade brawler, you're dropped into a nonstop brawl where men just keep coming—and your fists do the talking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash, punch, and pummel your way enemies in an over-the-top frenzy and mayhem. Go for the classic 100-man challenge or see how long you can survive in unlimited mode. There are no waves, no breaks—just you, pure muscle, and a crowd of unlucky humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, addictive gameplay makes it easy to pick up and hard to put down. Whether you're jumping in for a quick session or chasing high-body-count glory, it's pure, primal chaos from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customization</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Gorilla</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change up your gorilla’s look with a full range of options — mix and match skin color, fur color, shorts, ties, glasses, and hats to make your fighter stand out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a gorilla in a hilarious brawler</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch and pummel endless enemies in brutal, chaotic combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two modes: Beat 100 men or face an unlimited onslaught</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant action, no fluff—just pure arcade fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdoll physics make every fight wild and unpredictable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear your rear with a hilarious fart-poop blast that sends foes flying behind you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pound your chest to unleash a powerful shockwave, forcing all nearby enemies to step back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly re-playable with short, intense gameplay sessions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can one gorilla beat 100 men? There’s only one way to find out.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Can one gorilla beat 100 men? Step in, start swinging, and find out. Play as a gorilla in a chaotic ragdoll brawler where you punch, pummel, and try to survive. Go for 100 or push yourself in unlimited mode and see how long you last.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Vietnamese, Czech, Polish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657450/a27ca09c88aa3fed2b3d2945f89e5d1d2a38d9bd/header.jpg?t=1756168349", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657450/4cdd7e0a1fae92d2b7ad3d160eb74300d1d0463b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756168349", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657450/4cdd7e0a1fae92d2b7ad3d160eb74300d1d0463b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756168349", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> \tWind